# Frontend build inputs the image regenerates for itself. A host `node_modules/`
# shipped in the build context is both large and wrong (native deps are built for the
# host, not the image), and pnpm refuses to clobber a foreign store without a TTY.
# The Dockerfile's ui-build stage installs from the lockfile instead.
**/node_modules/
**/.svelte-kit/
packages/viewer/src/board_reader_viewer/web/
